+## Cortex-M4 is ARMv7E-M with optional architectural extensions.  Verify that
+## the backend obtains the input DSP/FPU capabilities from ELF attributes,
+## decodes and re-emits those instructions, and refuses a mismatched M3 CPU.
+
+# RUN: llvm-mc -filetype=obj -triple thumbv7em-none-eabihf -mcpu=cortex-m4 \
+# RUN:   -mattr=+dsp,+vfp4 %s -o %t.o
