+## Exercise the first whole-image Cortex-M relocation path.  Unlike compact
+## publication, this mode may change function addresses.  The test checks the
+## complete chain: explicit opt-in, typed flash placement, Thumb-state data
+## pointers, direct-call repair, alternate code-label movement, relocation
+## section ownership, and exact original-to-output instruction identities.
+
+# RUN: split-file %s %t
