+# LOG: ICP rejected mutable/unmapped Cortex-M method slot at
+# LOG: Cortex-M ICP generator inputs in virtual_caller:
+# LOG-SAME: vtables=0
+# LOG-SAME: fetch-insns=0
+# LOG: ICP percentage of method calls candidates that have loads eliminated = 0.0%
+
