@@ -0,0 +1,88 @@
+## Firm-BOLT qualifies Thumb-2 indirect tail-call promotion independently of
+## ordinary calls. The hot direct branch and original BX fallback share one
+## exact original identity and require an explicit tail-call event contract.
+
+# RUN: llvm-mc -filetype=obj -triple thumbv7m-none-eabi -mcpu=cortex-m3 \
+# RUN:   %s -o %t.o
+# RUN: ld.lld --emit-relocs -Ttext=0x08000000 -e Reset_Handler %t.o -o %t.exe
