@@ -0,0 +1,96 @@
+## Firm-BOLT promotes a hot Cortex-M TBB index only under a distinct
+## compare/branch-event contract.  The guard branches directly to the typed
+## case label; every non-matching index executes the original TBB fallback.
+
+# RUN: llvm-mc -filetype=obj -triple thumbv7m-none-eabi -mcpu=cortex-m3 \
+# RUN:   %s -o %t.o
+# RUN: ld.lld --emit-relocs -Ttext=0x08000000 -e Reset_Handler %t.o -o %t.exe
