+## Cortex-M tail-duplication propagation has an independent firmware contract.
+## The accepted case propagates a Thumb-2 immediate through the duplicated
+## register-only tail, deletes its defining move, preserves flags and records
+## exact clone provenance.  The same requested transform is rejected without
+## that contract.
+
+# RUN: llvm-mc -filetype=obj -triple thumbv7m-none-eabi -mcpu=cortex-m3 \
