@@ -0,0 +1,45 @@
+## A correctly typed slot is still invalid if the original image can reach it.
+## The reservation contract permits replacement only of non-entry capacity.
+
+# RUN: llvm-mc -filetype=obj -triple thumbv6m-none-eabi -mcpu=cortex-m0plus \
+# RUN:   %s -o %t.o
+# RUN: ld.lld --emit-relocs -Ttext=0x08000000 \
