+## Qualify external Thumb-1 call-veneer placement only in a linker-declared
+## firmware slot.  Strict guest-instruction-count preservation remains enabled:
+## the source call keeps one instruction and the reserved slot's placeholder
+## count is explicitly outside the admitted original execution contract.
