+## Cloning a shared pool is legal for value loads, but not for ADR: ADR makes
+## the pool address itself observable.  Retain the original function rather
+## than silently giving different paths different addresses.
+
+# RUN: llvm-mc -filetype=obj -triple thumbv6m-none-eabi -mcpu=cortex-m0plus %s -o %t.o
+# RUN: ld.lld -Ttext=0x08000000 -e Reset_Handler %t.o -o %t.exe
