+## Exercise R_ARM_THM_JUMP6 through the executable reader, ARM relocation
+## handler, compact writer, and retained SHT_REL path.  LLVM MC and LLD do not
+## normally produce this narrow external relocation, so model the conforming
+## post-link executable directly.  The bytes are a resolved CBNZ r0 to P+4.
+
+# RUN: yaml2obj %s -o %t.exe
+# RUN: llvm-readelf -r %t.exe | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=INPUT
+# RUN: llvm-bolt %t.exe --firmbolt-cortex-m-cpu=cortex-m3 \
